From 66633a80c93f7e5ac32455346b09f9aade29875b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 22:51:58 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): persist desktop GPU startup diagnostics

Append and synchronize console-less desktop logs before GPU work.
Keep adapter driver metadata, panic and startup backtraces, and recovery hints.
Preserve terminal filtering, the previous panic hook, and prior-run evidence.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2421
